# Scene2-2-12

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐12
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:30_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_22_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:早餐时间后。|#0202Adv12_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了做好谋杀艾玛的准备工作，<br>我悄悄来到淋浴房。|#0202Adv12_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:淋浴房的墙壁上，<br>还是一如既往画着一幅巨大的壁画。|#0202Adv12_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:【气球】吗……|#0202Adv12_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然也可以问问诺亚本人，<br>但她估计并不在意这些名头吧。|#0202Adv12_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（能感受到<br>　她真的只是纯粹地喜欢画画）|#0202Adv12_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（对于她来说，只要可以画画，<br>　似乎身在何处都无关紧要。即使是在这座监牢）|#0202Adv12_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我再次仔细端详诺亚的画，<br>不禁笑了起来。|#0202Adv12_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（既然她在这里能够毫无压力地生活下去，<br>　应该就不需要担心她堕为魔女了）|#0202Adv12_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:沉浸在思绪中，<br>忽然，我猛地回过神来。|#0202Adv12_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（现在要做的事和诺亚无关吧！<br>　怎么能不把精力集中在头等大事上）|#0202Adv12_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我重新打起精神，继续推进准备工作。|#0202Adv12_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要做的事很简单。<br>只需事先在垃圾滑槽上动动手脚。|#0202Adv12_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要把艾玛之死伪装成意外，<br>需要制造相应的证据。|#0202Adv12_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:"（所以……垃圾滑槽的盖子<br>　要做成【年久失修导致损坏】的样子）|#0202Adv12_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不幸的是，艾玛没有注意到这件事，<br>　走近后一时失去平衡，掉下去了……）|#0202Adv12_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她因为头部遭受猛烈的撞击而晕了过去，<br>　然后又不幸撞上焚烧炉启动的时间……）|#0202Adv12_Hiro008|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（就这样，艾玛被烧死在那里）|#0202Adv12_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……这就是我的剧本）|#0202Adv12_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:必须在发现命案之前，就对滑槽下手。|#0202Adv12_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为若是艾玛失踪后<br>被人看到我动手脚的场面，<br>就会加深自己的嫌疑。|#0202Adv12_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果事先动手脚的话，<br>万一被人目击，也能设法为自己开脱。<br>最差的情况不过是计划中止。|#0202Adv12_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我杀死艾玛后，<br>　只要等到有人找到【艾玛死亡是事故的证据】，<br>　再配合证据发表我的推理就好）|#0202Adv12_Hiro011|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（结论是【因为垃圾滑槽故障，<br>　艾玛不幸地失去了生命】）|#0202Adv12_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（总会有狡辩的余地。<br>　毕竟……没有任何证据能证明是他杀）|#0202Adv12_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:（好，赶快把事情办完吧）|#0202Adv12_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:1

[PrintTextModified Text:我拿起在画室里找到的工具，<br>走向垃圾滑槽——|#0202Adv12_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:稍稍拧松螺丝|#0202Adv12_Choice001| Lock:false AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
    @GotoModified Path:.Choice2-2-1

@AddChoice ChoiceSummary:以防万一调查内部|#0202Adv12_Choice002| Lock:false ButtonPath:ChoiceButtons/Adv/Bad AutoPlay:true ShowHandler:true
    @GotoModified Path:Act02_Chapter02/Act02_Chapter02_Bad01 ResetState:-
