# Choice2-2-1

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:18

; ネジをゆるめる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_128 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:2

[PrintTextModified Text:然后稍稍拧松盖子上的螺丝。|#0202Adv12_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这样就好。接下来只要等待约定的时间到来。<br>　……不对，还有一个隐患）|#0202Adv12_Hiro015|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:30_2
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.2 TintColor:#B09060 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:那就是可可。|#0202Adv12_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她有时候会来隔音比较好的淋浴房<br>　做直播……）|#0202Adv12_Hiro016|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果到了我和艾玛约定的时间，<br>可可正好想来淋浴房直播了，我该怎么办？|#0202Adv12_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当我想到这个计划的时候，就已经留意到了这个问题。|#0202Adv12_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我拟了几个解决方案，<br>比如给可可提供一个更好的直播场地，等等。|#0202Adv12_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，小动作做得太多的话，<br>很可能导致自己之后被人怀疑。|#0202Adv12_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最后我还是没想出什么具体对策，<br>就这样到了计划当天。|#0202Adv12_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#FFFFFF Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:30_2
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:（其实不止可可一个隐患）|#0202Adv12_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他少女也可能来到淋浴房。<br>|#0202Adv12_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:（到那时就只能想办法巧妙地赶她们走了）|#0202Adv12_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

